OL,3,GNEWSALifeguards to remain at 15 beaches
OL,4,Aover half-term
OL,5,
OL,6,FLifeguards are to work an extra week
OL,7,Facross 15 beaches to cover the school
OL,8,Fhalf-term holiday.
OL,10,FThe RNLI said the extra patrols would
OL,11,Frun daily from 17 October to 1 November
OL,12,Fat some Cornwall beaches to make sure
OL,13,Ffamilies, visitors and local residents
OL,14,Fcould enjoy "safer visits" to the coast
OL,15,Fduring the holiday period.
OL,17,FGuy Botterill, RNLI regional lifeguard
OL,18,Flead for the South West, said risks at
OL,19,Fthe coast remained although the summer
OL,20,Fwas over.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
