OL,3,GNEWSALifeguards to remain at 15 beaches
OL,4,Aover half-term
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "Autumn can bring powerful
OL,7,Fwaves, strong rip currents and rapidly
OL,8,Fchanging weather conditions, so we'd
OL,9,Fencourage anyone planning a trip to the
OL,10,Fbeach to choose a lifeguarded beach
OL,11,Fwhenever possible and speak to our
OL,12,Flifeguards for local safety advice."
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
